<title>USA: Westbridge Capital names Crosley president.</title>
<headline>Westbridge Capital names Crosley president.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westbridge Capital Corp said  on Thursday that it named Fred Crosley as president, chief operating  officer and director.</p>
<p>Crosley succeeds James Thigpen, who retired after 17 years at the  company.</p>
<p>Crosely is the former president of Conseco Inc's Bankers Life and  Causualty Co, Westbridge said in a statement.</p>
